Distant Horizons Polygon Fix is an unofficial, independent compatibility mod.
It is not an official Distant Horizons release.

This project backports the GL_POLYGON_MODE fix incorporated from upstream !126:
https://gitlab.com/distant-horizons-team/distant-horizons/-/merge_requests/126
https://gitlab.com/distant-horizons-team/distant-horizons/-/commit/51bf1f319b56e233ac8e0e8189cd7350444da0f6

